    # naomi "No matter what I suggest, it's always the same answer - 'You're not supposed to work.'"
    naomi "不管我提什么，答案都一样——‘你不该干活。’"

# game/scripts/Characters/naomi.rpy:596
translate chinese_simp naomi_farm_work_four_183351af:

    # player "I'll talk to [sally], there's gotta be {i}something{/i} extra you can do."
    player "我去跟 [sally] 说，肯定有 {i}些{/i} 别的事你能做。"

